cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LocoMuJoCo in your research, please cite the paper given under
  "preferred-citation", which describes the current version, and the original
  paper on version 0.1.0, given under "references".
type: software
title: "LocoMuJoCo: A Comprehensive Imitation Learning Benchmark for Whole-Body Control"
abstract: >-
  LocoMuJoCo is a library for imitation and reinforcement learning on whole-body
  control. It runs the same environments on MuJoCo (CPU), MJX and MuJoCo Warp
  (GPU), and provides humanoid robots, quadrupeds and (musculo-)skeletal human
  models with retargeted motion capture data, a human-to-robot and
  robot-to-robot retargeting pipeline, JAX implementations of learning
  algorithms, and trajectory-similarity metrics.
